<view class="page"><view class="title">每一天，都值得一点甜</view><view class="subtitle">家家乐蛋糕店 · 把心意做成蛋糕</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load">{{error}}</view><view class="panel"><view class="section-title">门店信息</view><view class="data-row"><text class="label">营业时间</text><text>{{shop.openTime}}–{{shop.closeTime}}</text></view><view class="data-row"><text class="label">门店地址</text><text>{{shop.address || '待补充'}}</text></view><view class="data-row"><text class="label">联系电话</text><text>{{shop.phone || '待补充'}}</text></view><view class="data-row"><text class="label">配送服务</text><text>暂不收费，配送范围由店员逐单确认。</text></view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="orders">我的订单</button><button wx:if="{{shop.phone}}" class="outline" bindtap="contact">联系门店</button></view></view><view class="panel"><view class="section-title">预订与售后</view><view class="small muted">{{shop.afterSalesPolicy}}</view><view class="info">先提交预订，店员确认后付30%定金。交付时收尾款，支持小程序付款或线下收款登记。</view></view><button class="outline" bindtap="staff">店员入口</button><view class="footnote">演示版 · 所有付款、退款和消息提醒均为模拟</view></view>
